        <Summary>DOSBox-X is a cross-platform DOS emulator based on DOSBox.</Summary>
        <Description>DOSBox-X is an open-source cross-platform DOS emulator for running DOS applications and games. Compared to DOSBox, DOSBox-X is much more flexible and provides more features. It officially supports DOS-based Windows such as Windows 3.x and Windows 9x, and also adds support for DOS/V and NEC PC-98 emulations.</Description>
